e":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"私は紫水、天宮紫水。よろしく、お館くん。不思議そうな顔……まあ、そうだよね","en":"I'm Shisui, Amamiya Shisui. Nice to meet you, Captain. You look surprised... well, I guess that's to be expected"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00336_1/uni00336_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"お館くん、今日もまた図書館？　そう、なら先に行って待ってる","en":"Captain, you're at the library again today? Alright, I'll head on over and wait for you"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00336_1/uni00336_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"私は本来お館くんにしか見えないけれど、たまに見えてるんじゃないかって子がいる","en":"I'm usually only visible to Captain, but I wonder if there are others who can see me sometimes"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00336_1/uni00336_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"今のお館くん、いい感じだよ。うん、私がちゃんと守ってあげる","en":"You're looking good, Captain. Yeah, I'll make sure to protect you properly"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00336_1/uni00336_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"図書子って呼び方も嫌いじゃなかったけど、名前で呼ばれるのはもっといい","en":"I didn't mind being called \"Toshiko-san\" either, but being called by my name is even better"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00336_1/uni00336_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"お館くんの周りには色々な人がいる……かわってないね","en":"There are a lot of people around you, Captain... nothing's changed, has it?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00336_1/uni00336_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"私が使う波遁の術は珍しい忍法だけど……お館くんが興味津々で嬉しい","en":"The wave-style ninja art I use is a rare technique, but... I'm happy you're so interested, Captain"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00336_1/uni00336_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"前世の記憶が気になる……？　だめ、教えられない","en":"You're curious about my past life memories...? No, I won't tell you"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00336